              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** recursor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{motive : ℕ → Sort u} → motive Nat.zero → ((n : ℕ) → motive n → motive n.succ) → (t : ℕ) → motive t\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                "tags": [
