                {
                  "id": "0425057f-3b4f-4fe5-bd2f-34c50bff36df",
                  "text": "[证明] Add.add",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "d2a6c8c7-d464-40ad-8d43-564cb61cb476",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → [self : Add α] → α → α → α\n```\n\n**文档**\n`a + b` computes the sum of `a` and `b`. See `HAdd`.",
