                },
                {
                  "id": "2cefd0ba-8927-49e0-b29f-f4532c17cc37",
                  "text": "[陈述] HAdd.hAdd",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "d2a6c8c7-d464-40ad-8d43-564cb61cb476",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → {β : Type v} → {γ : outParam (Type w)} → [self : HAdd α β γ] → α → β → γ\n```\n\n**文档**\n`a + b` computes the sum of `a` and `b`.\nThe meaning of this notation is type-dependent.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
