                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "c3bdcc3d-7eed-47cd-b56d-8e4a46949888",
                  "text": "[证明] HAdd.mk",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "d2a6c8c7-d464-40ad-8d43-564cb61cb476",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → {β : Type v} → {γ : outParam (Type w)} → (α → β → γ) → HAdd α β γ\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
