                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.Nat.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ (x : ℕ) (f : Nat.below (motive := fun x => ∀ (x_1 : ℕ), x_1.succ + x = (x_1 + x).succ) x) (x_1 : ℕ), x_1.succ + x = (x_1 + x).succ\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
