                {
                  "id": "1c93efbe-6bb0-42d1-9315-6bbe628dc3b0",
                  "text": "[内部] PProd",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "9aa6ef59-1d1c-404d-ae34-e69a369a794d",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nSort u → Sort v → Sort (max (max 1 u) v)\n```\n\n**文档**\nA product type in which the types may be propositions, usually written `α ×' β`.\n\nThis type is primarily used internally and as an implementation detail of proof automation. It is\nrarely useful in hand-written code.\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "内部",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f9fafb",
                    "color": "#6b7280",
                    "fontSize": 12,
                    "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "91bbd9a1-f80f-477f-ac9c-78770fefd5da",
                  "text": "[内部] PProd.mk",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "9aa6ef59-1d1c-404d-ae34-e69a369a794d",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Sort u} → {β : Sort v} → α → β → α ×' β\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "内部",
                      "constructor"
