                {
                  "id": "a3b6b39f-fe84-4e7d-925a-486e80b43708",
                  "text": "[内部] PUnit",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "9aa6ef59-1d1c-404d-ae34-e69a369a794d",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nSort u\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe canonical universe-polymorphic type with just one element.\n\nIt should be used in contexts that require a type to be universe polymorphic, thus disallowing\n`Unit`.\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "内部",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f9fafb",
                    "color": "#6b7280",
                    "fontSize": 12,
                    "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "c235e596-aee4-4749-b8e7-5b7b569a5e87",
                  "text": "[内部] PUnit.unit",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "9aa6ef59-1d1c-404d-ae34-e69a369a794d",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nPUnit.{u}\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe only element of the universe-polymorphic unit type.\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "内部",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f9fafb",
                    "color": "#6b7280",
                    "fontSize": 12,
                    "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "74d64ef6-bc28-4e96-be6d-e24d19c8398d",
                  "text": "[内部] Unit",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "9aa6ef59-1d1c-404d-ae34-e69a369a794d",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe canonical type with one element. This element is written `()`.\n\n`Unit` has a number of uses:\n* It can be used to model control flow that returns from a function call without providing other\n  information.\n* Monadic actions that return `Unit` have side effects without computing values.\n* In polymorphic types, it can be used to indicate that no data is to be stored in a particular\n  field.\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "内部",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f9fafb",
                    "color": "#6b7280",
                    "fontSize": 12,
                    "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "9e0c3f60-e76a-461c-b423-d2d08c22d2a2",
                  "text": "[内部] Unit.unit",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "9aa6ef59-1d1c-404d-ae34-e69a369a794d",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nUnit\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe only element of the unit type.\n\nIt can be written as an empty tuple: `()`.\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "内部",
                      "definition"
                    ]
